# Derived upstream data is generated, never committed (docs/DECISIONS.md D1.4). What ships is
# the fetch script, the upstream digests, the expected checksums, and de minimis aggregates.
#
# Deny by default with an allowlist. Naming files individually failed once: the rule listed
# labels.csv, so a sidecar added later was tracked and per-instance ids were committed. A new
# derived file is now ignored unless someone deliberately permits it here.
experiments/*/derived/*
!experiments/*/derived/aggregates.json

# Claude Code session metadata is runtime state, never a repository artifact.
.claude/
